docs {
  # Create Trip Day - Day 1 (Arrival)

  Example of a TRANSIT type day for arrival in Japan.

  ## Trip Timeline
  - 14:00: Arrive at Narita Airport (arrival_time: 1735711200)
  - 15:10: Depart on Narita Express (departure_time: 1735715400)
  - 16:30: Arrive at Shinjuku Station
  - 17:30: Hotel check-in (accommodation_checkin: 1735722000)
  - 19:00: Dinner at local restaurants

  ## Transit Details
  The `transit_details` field is flexible JSON that can contain:
  - carrier: Train/airline/bus company name
  - route: Detailed route description
  - departure_location: Where transit starts
  - arrival_location: Where transit ends
  - duration_minutes: How long the transit takes
  - ticket_type: Type of ticket/reservation
  - cost: Cost in local currency
  - confirmation_number: Booking reference
  - seat: Seat assignment (if applicable)
  - Additional fields as needed (gate, terminal, etc.)

  ## Timestamps
  - arrival_time: 1735711200 = 2025-01-01 14:00 JST (when arriving at destination)
  - departure_time: 1735715400 = 2025-01-01 15:10 JST (when leaving for destination)
  - accommodation_checkin: 1735722000 = 2025-01-01 17:30 JST
}
